#: processes/wireframe-design-review.bpmn:13
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "WireGen (methodologies/wiregen) made executable: a written design intent, at least two mid-fidelity candidates each with a web AND a mobile layout, mechanical checks, a blind per-criterion review, adjudication where reviewers disagree, and a recorded choice. A wireframe is part of the design process for adjudication (owner, 2026-09-23). Operating skill: wireframe-design-review. Issue #1023."
msgstr ""

